{"speciesId":376,"names":{"fr":"Métalosse","es":"Metagross","en":"Metagross","ja":"メタグロス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"METAGROSS has four brains in total. Combined, the four brains can breeze through difficult calculations faster than a supercomputer. This POKéMON can float in the air by tucking in its four legs."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"METAGROSS is the result of two METANG achieving fusion. When hunting, this POKéMON pins the prey to the ground under its massive body. It then eats the helpless victim using the large mouth on its stomach."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"METAGROSS has four brains that are joined by a complex neural network. As a result of integration, this POKéMON is smarter than a supercomputer."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It is formed by two METANG fusing. Its four brains are said to be superior to a supercomputer."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It is formed by two METANG fusing. Its four brains are said to be superior to a supercomputer."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"METANG combined to form it. With four brains, it has the intelligence of a supercomputer."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"METANG combined to form it. With four brains, it has the intelligence of a supercomputer."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"METANG combined to form it. With four brains, it has the intelligence of a supercomputer."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It folds its four legs when flying. Its four brains are said to be superior to a supercomputer."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It folds its four legs when flying. Its four brains are said to be superior to a supercomputer."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il est né de la fusion de plusieurs Métang. Ses quatre cerveaux en font l’égal d’un superordinateur."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Metang combined to form it. With four brains, it has the intelligence of a supercomputer."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il est né de la fusion de plusieurs Métang. Ses quatre cerveaux en font l’égal d’un superordinateur."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Metang combined to form it. With four brains, it has the intelligence of a supercomputer."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"With four linked brains, it’s more intelligent than a supercomputer, and it uses calculations to analyze foes."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"With four linked brains, it’s more intelligent than a supercomputer, and it uses calculations to analyze foes."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il est né de la fusion de plusieurs Terhal. Ses quatre cerveaux en font l’égal d’un superordinateur."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Gracias a sus cuatro cerebros, es más inteligente que un superordenador y analiza con precisión al enemigo."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"With four linked brains, it’s more intelligent than a supercomputer, and it uses calculations to analyze foes."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"４つの 脳みそが 連なり スーパーコンピュータより すごい 計算で 相手を 分析する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il est né de la fusion de plusieurs Métang. Ses quatre cerveaux en font l’égal d’un superordinateur."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Está formado por varios Metang. Con cuatro cerebros, tiene la inteligencia de un superordenador."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Metang combined to form it. With four brains, it has the intelligence of a supercomputer."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"メタングが 合体して 生まれた。 ４つの 脳を 持つ メタグロスは スーパーコンピュータ並みの 知能。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Métalosse dispose de quatre cerveaux. Combinés, ces cerveaux peuvent effectuer des calculs très complexes plus vite qu’un ordinateur. Ce Pokémon peut flotter dans l’air en repliant ses jambes."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Metagross tiene cuatro cerebros en total que, combinados, son capaces de resolver cálculos complicados más rápido que el mejor ordenador que haya. Metagross puede flotar en el aire si mete las patas hacia adentro."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Metagross has four brains in total. Combined, the four brains can breeze through difficult calculations faster than a supercomputer. This Pokémon can float in the air by tucking in its four legs."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"４つの 脳みそは スーパーコンピュータよりも 速く 難しい 計算の 答えを 出す。 ４本脚を 折りたたみ 空中に 浮かぶ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Métalosse est le résultat de la fusion de deux Métang. Lorsqu’il chasse, ce Pokémon bloque sa proie au sol, sous son corps massif. Il mange ensuite la victime impuissante avec son énorme bouche, ouverte sur son estomac."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Metagross es el resultado de la fusión de dos Metang. Cuando caza, acorrala a su presa, sujetándola contra el suelo con el cuerpo. Después, devora a la víctima indefensa con la gran boca del estómago."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Metagross is the result of two Metang achieving fusion. When hunting, this Pokémon pins the prey to the ground under its massive body. It then eats the helpless victim using the large mouth on its stomach."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"２匹の メタングが 合体した 姿。 巨体で 獲物を 抑えつけながら お腹に ある 大きな 口で 食べるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Avec ses quatre groupes de griffes et son corps imposant, il immobilise ses victimes pour ensuite mieux les dévorer."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Con sus cuatro garras y su descomunal cuerpo aprisiona a sus presas para luego devorarlas con sus dientes."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It firmly pins its prey using its four claws and large body. Then the teeth in the mouth on its stomach chew the prey to bits."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"４つの ツメと 大きな 身体で 獲物を しっかり 押さえつけると お腹の 歯で バリバリ かじる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il est né de l’assemblage de deux Métang. Avec ses quatre cerveaux montés en parallèle, il peut résoudre n’importe quelle équation."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Metagross es el resultado de la fusión de dos Metang. Con sus cuatro cerebros funcionando en paralelo realiza cualquier cálculo al instante."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"A linkage of two Metang, this Pokémon can perform any calculation in a flash by utilizing parallel processing in its four brains."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"２匹の メタングが 連結。 ４つの 脳の 並列処理で どんな 計算も あっという間。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il est aussi fier de sa force physique que de ses pouvoirs psychiques. Il immobilise ses proies avec les griffes d’acier de ses quatre pattes."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Se enorgullece tanto de su poder psíquico como de su gran fuerza. Agarra a sus presas con las cuatro extremidades metálicas y las inmoviliza."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It boasts not only psychic powers but also fantastic strength. It grabs its prey with its four legs and holds them in place with its claws."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"サイコパワーだけでなく 怪力も 自慢。 ４本の 足で 獲物を つかみ ツメで 動きを 封じる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Implacable, il analyse son ennemi encore plus précisément qu’un superordinateur et le pousse dans ses derniers retranchements."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Analiza al enemigo con más precisión incluso que un superordenador y, sin inmutarse, lo pone contra las cuerdas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It analyzes its opponents with more accuracy than a supercomputer, which enables it to calmly back them into a corner."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"スーパーコンピュータよりも すごい 判断で 相手を 分析し 冷静に 追い詰めていくのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Les Métalosse vivant sur des pics enneigés sont très actifs, car leur force magnétique augmente lorsque la température est inférieure à zéro."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Su fuerza magnética se potencia en temperaturas bajo cero, por lo que los Metagross que habitan en montañas nevadas son especialmente vivaces."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Because the magnetic powers of these Pokémon get stronger in freezing temperatures, Metagross living on snowy mountains are full of energy."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"気温が 氷点下になると 磁力が 強まるので 雪山に 棲む メタグロスは とても 元気。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Né de la fusion de deux Métang, il vient à bout de ses ennemis grâce à son cerveau qui est aussi performant qu’un superordinateur."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Formado a partir de la unión de dos Metang. Emplea su inteligencia, comparable a la de un superordenador, para derrotar a sus rivales."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Metagross is the result of the fusion of two Metang. This Pokémon defeats its opponents through use of its supercomputer-level brain."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"２匹の メタングが 合体した 姿。 スーパーコンピュータ並みの 頭脳を 駆使して 敵を 倒す。"}],"varieties":[{"id":376,"moves":[{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tuto